"Kids and young people are given the chance to have fun, develop "
"relationships and play in a safe space."
msgstr ""
"Børn og unge får chancen for at have det sjovt, udvikle relationer og lege i "
"et sikkert rum."

#. module: child_compassion
#: model:field.office.learning,description:child_compassion.learning_ke3
msgid ""
"Kids and young people are given the chance to have fun, develop "
"relationships and play in a safe space. A typical snack may be a cup of "
"porridge, a slice of bread, fruit or an egg."
msgstr ""
"Børn og unge får chancen for at have det sjovt, udvikle relationer og lege i "
"et sikkert rum. En typisk snack kan være en kop grød, et stykke brød, frugt "
"eller et æg."

#. module: child_compassion
#: model:field.office.learning,description:child_compassion.learning_ph3
msgid ""
"Kids and young people are given the chance to have fun, develop "
"relationships and play in a safe space. Bread, soup or another local "
"delicacy are often served as a snack."
msgstr ""
"Børn og unge får chancen for at have det sjovt, udvikle relationer og lege i "
"et sikkert rum. Brød, suppe eller en anden lokal delikatesse serveres ofte "
"som en snack."

#. module: child_compassion
#: model:field.office.learning,description:child_compassion.learning_gu3
msgid ""
"Kids and young people are given the chance to have fun, develop "
"relationships and play in a safe space. Children are get a substantial snack "
"such as cereal and a banana or a sandwich and fruit."
msgstr ""
"Børn og unge får chancen for at have det sjovt, udvikle relationer og lege i "
"et sikkert rum. Børn får en solid snack som f.eks. morgenmadsprodukter og en "
"banan eller en sandwich og frugt."

#. module: child_compassion
#: model:field.office.learning,description:child_compassion.learning_ug3
msgid ""
"Kids and young people are given the chance to have fun, develop "
"relationships and play in a safe space. Every child is provided with a "
"nutritional snack such as tea, porridge and a bun."
msgstr ""
"Børn og unge får chancen for at have det sjovt, udvikle relationer og lege i "
"et sikkert rum. Hvert barn får en nærende snack som te, grød og en bolle."

