#. module: child_compassion
#: model:field.office.learning,description:child_compassion.learning_ke8
msgid ""
"Projects in Kenya also offer a variety of extracurricular activities "
"including an annual football competition, teen camps held during the "
"holidays and talent days where children perform music, drama or poems. When "
"they reach the age of 12, young people benefit from skills training, such as "
"computer training, carpentry, motor vehicle repair, dressmaking, cooking, "
"hairdressing, driving and life skills."
msgstr ""
"Projekter i Kenya tilbyder også en række fritidsaktiviteter, herunder en "
"årlig fodboldkonkurrence, teenagerelejr i ferierne og talentdage, hvor børn "
"opfører musik, drama eller digte. Når de når 12-årsalderen, drager unge "
"fordel af færdighedstræning, såsom computeruddannelse, snedkeri, "
"motorreparation, kjolesyning, madlavning, frisør, kørsel og livsfærdigheder."

#. module: child_compassion
#: model:field.office.learning,description:child_compassion.learning_tz8
msgid ""
"Projects in Tanzania also offer extra curriculum activities including "
"sports, games, camping and tree-planting in community areas. Children also "
"participate in public celebrations such as AIDS Day, the Day of the African "
"Child or Uhuru Day. Parents and caregivers are offered parenting classes."
msgstr ""
"Projekter i Tanzania tilbyder også ekstra læseplansaktiviteter, herunder "
"sport, spil, camping og træplantning i lokalsamfundets områder. Børn "
"deltager også i offentlige festligheder som f.eks. AIDS-dagen, den "
"afrikanske børnedag eller Uhuru-dagen. Forældre og omsorgspersoner tilbydes "
"forældreundervisning."

#. module: child_compassion
#: model:field.office.learning,description:child_compassion.learning_th8
msgid ""
"Projects in Thailand offer extracurricular activities such as music, "
"community sports days, as well as community service opportunities such as "
"anti-drug campaigns. These activities are generally held during school "
"holidays. Parents and caregivers are also offered income-generation classes "
"and projects hold special family events such as camps and celebrations for "
"Mother's Day and Father's Day."
msgstr ""
"Projekter i Thailand tilbyder fritidsaktiviteter såsom musik, lokale "
"sportsdage samt muligheder for samfundstjeneste, såsom anti-narkotika-"
"kampagner. Disse aktiviteter afholdes generelt i skoleferierne. Forældre og "
"omsorgspersoner tilbydes også indkomstgenererende klasser, og projekter "
"afholder særlige familiebegivenheder som f.eks. lejre og fejringer for mors "
"dag og fars dag."

#. module: child_compassion
#: model:field.office.learning,description:child_compassion.learning_tg8
msgid ""
"Projects in Togo also offer a variety of extracurricular activities "
"including musical instrument playing, choreography, choir, artwork, football "
"and puzzles. Parents and caregivers are offered parenting classes."
msgstr ""
"Projekter i Togo tilbyder også en række fritidsaktiviteter, herunder "
"musikalsk instrument playing, koreografi, kor, kunstværk, fodbold og "
"puslespil. Forældre og omsorgspersoner tilbydes forældreundervisning."

